Selected Idea
-------------

Introduce Nuëyon: an AI-first company for other AI-first businesses, with Nuëyon.Compose as the first concrete step
A company-introduction piece that states Nuëyon’s central identity and immediate focus: it is being built as an AI-first (possibly AI-only) company that aims to deliver reusable AI-native products for businesses that place AI at their center. The article uses Nuëyon.Compose—the staged workflow for turning ideas and accumulated knowledge into publishable content—as the concrete example that grounds the broader vision while preserving the early-stage boundaries.

